### stopwatch

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"nominal stopwatch_python =\n    `(\n        global \"import timeit\"\n        $'' : $'timeit.default_timer'\n    )\ntype stopwatch_switch =\n    {\n        Fsharp : $'System.Diagnostics.Stopwatch'\n        Python : stopwatch_python\n        Rust : $'std::time::Instant'\n    }\nnominal stopwatch = $'backend_switch `(stopwatch_switch)'\n\ninl stopwatch () : stopwatch =\n    backend_switch {\n        Fsharp = fun () => $'`stopwatch ()' : stopwatch\n        Python = fun () => $'`stopwatch ' : stopwatch\n        // Rust: an Instant runs from its creation (stopwatch_start is a no-op there)\n        Rust = fun () => $'std::time::Instant::now()' : stopwatch\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  nominal stopwatch_python =
      `(
          global "import timeit"
          $'' : $'timeit.default_timer'
      )
  type stopwatch_switch =
      {
          Fsharp : $'System.Diagnostics.Stopwatch'
          Python : stopwatch_python
          Rust : $'std::time::Instant'
      }
  nominal stopwatch = $'backend_switch `(stopwatch_switch)'

  inl stopwatch () : stopwatch =
      backend_switch {
          Fsharp = fun () => $'`stopwatch ()' : stopwatch
          Python = fun () => $'`stopwatch ' : stopwatch
          // Rust: an Instant runs from its creation (stopwatch_start is a no-op there)
          Rust = fun () => $'std::time::Instant::now()' : stopwatch
      }
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl stopwatch_elapsed_milliseconds (stopwatch : stopwatch) : i64 =\n    if is_rust ()\n    then $'(!stopwatch.elapsed().as_millis() as i64)'\n    else $'!stopwatch.ElapsedMilliseconds'","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

