### date_time_from_guid

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl date_time_from_guid (date_time_guid : date_time_guid) =\n    inl date_time_guid = date_time_guid |> sm'.obj_to_string\n    inl sm_replace = sm'.replace \"-\" \"\"\n    run_target_args (fun () => sm_replace) function\n        | Rust => fun _ =>\n            $'{ let s = !date_time_guid[..25].replace(\"-\", \"\"); chrono::NaiveDateTime::parse_from_str(&s[0..14], \"%Y%m%d%H%M%S\").unwrap() + chrono::TimeDelta::nanoseconds(s[14..21].parse::<i64>().unwrap() * 100) }' : date_time\n        | TypeScript _ => fun sm_replace =>\n            $'System.DateTime.Parse (!date_time_guid.[..24] |> !sm_replace)' : date_time\n        | _ => fun sm_replace => $'System.DateTime.ParseExact (!date_time_guid.[..24] |> !sm_replace, \"yyyyMMddHHmmssfffffff\", null)' : date_time","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl date_time_from_guid (date_time_guid : date_time_guid) =
      inl date_time_guid = date_time_guid |> sm'.obj_to_string
      inl sm_replace = sm'.replace "-" ""
      run_target_args (fun () => sm_replace) function
          | Rust => fun _ =>
              $'{ let s = !date_time_guid[..25].replace("-", ""); chrono::NaiveDateTime::parse_from_str(&s[0..14], "%Y%m%d%H%M%S").unwrap() + chrono::TimeDelta::nanoseconds(s[14..21].parse::<i64>().unwrap() * 100) }' : date_time
          | TypeScript _ => fun sm_replace =>
              $'System.DateTime.Parse (!date_time_guid.[..24] |> !sm_replace)' : date_time
          | _ => fun sm_replace => $'System.DateTime.ParseExact (!date_time_guid.[..24] |> !sm_replace, "yyyyMMddHHmmssfffffff", null)' : date_time
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

