### timestamp_guid_from_timestamp

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl timestamp_guid_from_timestamp (guid : guid.guid) (timestamp : timestamp) : timestamp_guid =\n    inl guid = guid |> sm'.obj_to_string\n    inl timestamp = timestamp |> sm'.obj_to_string |> sm'.pad_left 18i32 '0'\n    if is_rust ()\n    then $'Rc::<str>::from(format\\!(\"{}-{}-{}-{}{}\", &!timestamp[0..8], &!timestamp[8..12], &!timestamp[12..16], &!timestamp[16..18], &!guid[21..]))'\n    else $'`timestamp_guid $\"{!timestamp.[0..7]}-{!timestamp.[8..11]}-{!timestamp.[12..15]}-{!timestamp.[16..17]}{!guid.[21..]}\"'","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl timestamp_guid_from_timestamp (guid : guid.guid) (timestamp : timestamp) : timestamp_guid =
      inl guid = guid |> sm'.obj_to_string
      inl timestamp = timestamp |> sm'.obj_to_string |> sm'.pad_left 18i32 '0'
      if is_rust ()
      then $'Rc::<str>::from(format\!("{}-{}-{}-{}{}", &!timestamp[0..8], &!timestamp[8..12], &!timestamp[12..16], &!timestamp[16..18], &!guid[21..]))'
      else $'`timestamp_guid $"{!timestamp.[0..7]}-{!timestamp.[8..11]}-{!timestamp.[12..15]}-{!timestamp.[16..17]}{!guid.[21..]}"'
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

