### timestamp_from_guid

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl timestamp_from_guid (guid : date_time_guid) : timestamp =\n    inl guid = guid |> sm'.obj_to_string\n    if is_rust ()\n    then $'format\\!(\"{}{}{}{}\", &!guid[0..8], &!guid[9..13], &!guid[14..18], &!guid[19..21]).parse::<i64>().unwrap()'\n    else $'`i64 $\"{!guid.[0..7]}{!guid.[9..12]}{!guid.[14..17]}{!guid.[19..20]}\"'","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl timestamp_from_guid (guid : date_time_guid) : timestamp =
      inl guid = guid |> sm'.obj_to_string
      if is_rust ()
      then $'format\!("{}{}{}{}", &!guid[0..8], &!guid[9..13], &!guid[14..18], &!guid[19..21]).parse::<i64>().unwrap()'
      else $'`i64 $"{!guid.[0..7]}{!guid.[9..12]}{!guid.[14..17]}{!guid.[19..20]}"'
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

